WEBVTT

00:00:49.444 --> 00:00:54.074
DEAR X

00:00:54.825 --> 00:00:56.869
ALL CHARACTERS, PLACES, AND EVENTS
IN THIS WORK ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:56.952 --> 00:00:58.579
CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED
WITH GUARDIANS PRESENT

00:00:59.538 --> 00:01:00.539
Wedding, you say?

00:01:01.665 --> 00:01:06.086
I'll wipe away
all the stains from your past.

00:01:06.503 --> 00:01:09.423
And you'll start over by my side.

00:01:10.507 --> 00:01:11.508
What do you say?

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:14.720
No need to overthink it.

00:01:15.721 --> 00:01:16.805
All you have to do

00:01:17.723 --> 00:01:19.975
is just nod.

00:01:20.225 --> 00:01:21.894
Then everything will get easier.

00:01:23.312 --> 00:01:26.648
A safe, solid fence...

00:01:28.317 --> 00:01:29.902
That's what I need.

00:01:30.903 --> 00:01:33.572
Are you saying you can give me that?

00:01:37.743 --> 00:01:41.538
I'll give you anything.

00:01:41.622 --> 00:01:44.708
Can you prove what you just said?

00:01:48.462 --> 00:01:51.423
You need proof for my words?

00:01:53.217 --> 00:01:54.259
Say it anyway.

00:01:56.511 --> 00:01:58.013
That if I take your hand

00:01:59.181 --> 00:02:02.309
I'll be able to do everything I want.

00:02:12.069 --> 00:02:13.070
Shit.

00:02:14.321 --> 00:02:15.489
You okay?

00:02:27.251 --> 00:02:28.252
Move!

00:02:30.295 --> 00:02:31.713
We have to get out of here.

00:02:44.101 --> 00:02:45.477
Are you okay?

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.104
We need to move.

00:03:06.123 --> 00:03:08.083
I promise you, Ah-jin.

00:03:10.127 --> 00:03:11.128
Come to me.

00:03:33.191 --> 00:03:38.113
EPISODE 10: THE MONSTER IN THE MIRROR

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.619
Is Boss still not picking up?

00:03:46.955 --> 00:03:48.540
I need to go.

00:03:48.623 --> 00:03:49.624
To her place?

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.251
Yes.

00:03:52.627 --> 00:03:54.755
This is definitely connected to her.

00:03:59.676 --> 00:04:01.053
Yes, Mr. Hong.

00:04:07.726 --> 00:04:08.727
I understand.

00:04:18.987 --> 00:04:22.699
I should get going.
Grandpa's in critical condition.

00:04:24.117 --> 00:04:26.036
Can you try to find Ah-jin?

00:04:26.119 --> 00:04:27.204
Please.

00:04:27.454 --> 00:04:28.830
Okay, I'll take care of it.

00:05:21.049 --> 00:05:23.093
REST IN PEACE

00:05:23.176 --> 00:05:27.431
THE LATE YOON SEUNG-MO
GRANDSON: YOON JUN-SEO

00:07:22.379 --> 00:07:24.297
Gosh, I can finally digest a little.

00:07:25.674 --> 00:07:27.092
When it's time to go

00:07:28.677 --> 00:07:32.931
dying at the right time is
also a blessing.

00:07:33.223 --> 00:07:34.224
Excuse me!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.101
Here!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.104
One bowl of stew here!

00:07:40.105 --> 00:07:41.565
Gosh.

00:07:42.274 --> 00:07:44.484
Jeez, you're so slow.

00:07:54.369 --> 00:07:55.954
I got through to the boss.

00:07:57.289 --> 00:07:58.748
It seems like nothing's wrong.

00:07:58.832 --> 00:08:00.083
She says she'll call later.

00:08:01.001 --> 00:08:02.002
Okay.

00:08:06.923 --> 00:08:07.924
I'm off.

00:08:17.017 --> 00:08:20.395
Seriously, a new bag drops
even before a whole season passes.

00:08:20.478 --> 00:08:23.231
It's like they don't want me
to keep the ones I have.

00:08:25.525 --> 00:08:29.237
And all I see at the department store
are the exact same bags.

00:08:31.489 --> 00:08:32.490
Right.

00:08:34.034 --> 00:08:35.410
They seem to be in good condition.

00:08:36.077 --> 00:08:38.747
And most of them are
close to new, so...

00:08:39.539 --> 00:08:40.540
So?

00:08:44.502 --> 00:08:45.503
How much are they?

00:08:47.797 --> 00:08:48.840
Ms. Sim Sung-hee?

00:08:50.342 --> 00:08:51.676
- Yes?
- Hello.

00:08:54.846 --> 00:08:57.349
Judging by that reaction,
you're definitely guilty.

00:08:57.432 --> 00:08:59.267
You know why we're here, right?

00:09:03.855 --> 00:09:05.398
How would I know?

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:09.986
Okay.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.321
Sure.

00:09:12.322 --> 00:09:13.365
That was Ah-jin, right?

00:09:14.199 --> 00:09:16.409
She admitted she gave them
to me, didn't she?

00:09:17.577 --> 00:09:18.620
Let her go.

00:09:19.788 --> 00:09:20.789
Yes, sir.

00:09:25.752 --> 00:09:26.920
Have a good day, guys.

00:09:34.678 --> 00:09:37.555
Do I have to pick up calls
from the police because of you?

00:09:41.851 --> 00:09:43.395
I was just...

00:09:46.147 --> 00:09:47.691
I mean, you don't have a job now

00:09:47.774 --> 00:09:49.943
so I figured
I'd sell things to help you out.

00:09:50.694 --> 00:09:51.945
By selling my stuff?

00:09:53.738 --> 00:09:57.283
You're a known celebrity.

00:09:57.367 --> 00:09:59.577
It'd be embarrassing for you
to show up with these.

00:09:59.661 --> 00:10:01.329
So, I was just helping you out.

00:10:02.622 --> 00:10:04.999
Hey, I wasn't going to keep it all.

00:10:05.792 --> 00:10:08.169
I was at least going to split it
50-50 with you.

00:10:08.878 --> 00:10:11.589
You're unbelievable, Sung-hee.

00:10:14.008 --> 00:10:15.885
If you don't like 50-50, then 60-40.

00:10:17.762 --> 00:10:20.014
If you don't like 60-40, then 70-30!

00:10:20.098 --> 00:10:22.142
I'm fine with only 30 percent.

00:10:31.317 --> 00:10:34.112
Mr. Hong!

00:10:34.487 --> 00:10:36.239
I've been waiting ages for you.

00:10:36.322 --> 00:10:37.532
Have a drink with me.

00:10:37.615 --> 00:10:39.868
No, ma'am. I have work to do.

00:10:39.951 --> 00:10:41.202
What work?

00:10:41.286 --> 00:10:43.538
It's not like the dead man will care.

00:10:43.621 --> 00:10:44.873
Sit.

00:10:45.373 --> 00:10:47.333
Sit down.

00:10:47.417 --> 00:10:48.752
Do you know how long I waited?

00:10:49.544 --> 00:10:50.545
All right.

00:10:51.212 --> 00:10:53.882
Have a drink. Loosen up a bit.

00:10:54.424 --> 00:10:55.425
Cheers.

00:11:00.597 --> 00:11:02.557
You're quite the professional.

00:11:07.645 --> 00:11:11.900
So, how was the inheritance settled?

00:11:11.983 --> 00:11:16.029
I'm the only daughter-in-law
of this family, after all.

00:11:17.906 --> 00:11:21.326
There was no mention of your share.

00:11:23.703 --> 00:11:26.581
Out of all that money,
not a single piece for me?

00:11:27.207 --> 00:11:28.416
Not even ten won?

00:11:29.834 --> 00:11:34.255
Most of it was left
to your son, Jun-seo--

00:11:34.339 --> 00:11:36.841
He's the grandson.
Of course, he gets something.

00:11:36.925 --> 00:11:38.551
I'm talking about me.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.721
How...

00:11:42.472 --> 00:11:45.266
How could a man who doted
on his grandson, whom I raised

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:46.726
do this to me?

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.394
How could he?

00:11:48.478 --> 00:11:51.189
Ma'am, legally and morally

00:11:51.272 --> 00:11:52.899
there's no reason
you'd receive an inheritance.

00:11:52.982 --> 00:11:55.026
Jun-seo gets it, but why not me?

00:11:55.109 --> 00:11:56.903
I'm not asking for the same amount.

00:11:56.986 --> 00:11:59.489
Even a quarter or a tenth!

00:11:59.572 --> 00:12:01.950
He should have considered me
at least that much!

00:12:12.335 --> 00:12:13.753
Strictly speaking

00:12:13.837 --> 00:12:16.548
you and the late Chairman Yoon
are completely unrelated.

00:12:16.631 --> 00:12:18.049
Unrelated?

00:12:18.132 --> 00:12:19.467
Did you just call me unrelated?

00:12:20.552 --> 00:12:21.553
Thanks for bringing that up.

00:12:21.636 --> 00:12:24.013
Then is he his bloodline?

00:12:24.639 --> 00:12:25.890
He's also unrelated!

00:12:26.391 --> 00:12:29.102
Who do you think continued
this family line with no heirs?

00:12:29.185 --> 00:12:32.981
Even if I gave birth to and raised
someone else's child

00:12:33.064 --> 00:12:36.109
I made him a grandson worthy enough

00:12:36.192 --> 00:12:38.361
to be in this family!

00:12:39.904 --> 00:12:41.489
Ungrateful old man.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.033
I should have killed him.

00:12:46.828 --> 00:12:48.037
What did you just say?

00:12:51.666 --> 00:12:52.959
Jun-seo!

00:12:54.043 --> 00:12:55.837
I raised you!

00:12:56.588 --> 00:13:01.092
Now, pay me back,
adjusted for inflation!

00:13:01.175 --> 00:13:04.345
A hundredfold!

00:13:20.153 --> 00:13:23.114
You made me part of this family's
bloodline for inheritance?

00:13:24.908 --> 00:13:26.826
And you lied to me my whole life?

00:13:29.954 --> 00:13:33.041
Yes, I did.

00:13:33.374 --> 00:13:34.375
So what?

00:13:35.585 --> 00:13:36.586
Why?

00:13:39.672 --> 00:13:42.175
Why do you always live like this?

00:13:42.258 --> 00:13:44.260
That's how everybody lives.

00:13:44.344 --> 00:13:46.638
Those people in that funeral hall?

00:13:46.721 --> 00:13:50.683
They're all circling for scraps
from the old man's estate.

00:13:51.726 --> 00:13:55.521
They only pretend to be noble
on the outside.

00:13:55.605 --> 00:13:57.857
- Mom.
- I'm not the only one who lied.

00:13:57.941 --> 00:13:59.442
She also knew.

00:13:59.525 --> 00:14:01.569
Baek Ah-jin, that skank, knew.

00:14:01.653 --> 00:14:06.032
That little nine-year-old
started threatening me since then.

00:14:06.991 --> 00:14:07.992
She drove

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.663
a wedge between us

00:14:11.746 --> 00:14:13.706
and toyed with you.

00:14:15.041 --> 00:14:16.417
Is that why you hit her?

00:14:18.753 --> 00:14:21.089
You lied about me
being this family's son

00:14:21.172 --> 00:14:22.632
and brought her
into the house for that.

00:14:23.132 --> 00:14:24.842
It was all you.

00:14:30.098 --> 00:14:31.099
I...

00:14:33.643 --> 00:14:34.686
always knew...

00:14:36.688 --> 00:14:39.732
you were a bad person.

00:14:41.317 --> 00:14:43.528
Yet I still pitied you.

00:14:45.279 --> 00:14:47.699
I thought, "She must be struggling.

00:14:48.574 --> 00:14:49.993
That's why she's like that."

00:14:55.957 --> 00:15:01.087
I tried to understand you.
I tried so hard.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:04.924
And with Ah-jin,
I thought I should pay the price.

00:15:06.759 --> 00:15:08.261
But why did you do that to me?

00:15:22.108 --> 00:15:24.277
It was for you.

00:15:28.322 --> 00:15:31.242
So you could live with a good father.

00:15:32.493 --> 00:15:35.496
I didn't want you
inheriting my poverty.

00:15:40.251 --> 00:15:43.171
So, from the very beginning

00:15:44.964 --> 00:15:47.759
I was never
the true grandson of Grandpa

00:15:47.842 --> 00:15:50.219
and the wounds she's carried
all her life were because of me.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.777
Sure. Keep thinking that.

00:16:06.444 --> 00:16:09.113
Haunted by the past forever.

00:16:12.116 --> 00:16:13.117
Pathetic.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:31.761
Hey.

00:16:32.595 --> 00:16:33.596
Get out.

00:16:34.639 --> 00:16:35.640
Baek Ah-jin.

00:16:36.724 --> 00:16:38.017
You know this, right?

00:16:38.309 --> 00:16:42.063
After I dropped out of high school,
my family collapsed.

00:16:42.146 --> 00:16:45.274
That's when everything went
wrong for me.

00:16:46.025 --> 00:16:47.026
So?

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.153
What's that got to do with me?

00:16:50.488 --> 00:16:53.032
Why did you do that to me back then?

00:16:54.283 --> 00:16:56.911
I want an apology, though it's late.

00:16:57.912 --> 00:16:58.913
Sung-hee.

00:16:59.831 --> 00:17:02.542
Apologies are for people
who did something wrong.

00:17:04.877 --> 00:17:07.296
Are you not even a little sorry?

00:17:10.341 --> 00:17:11.676
Why would I be?

00:17:11.759 --> 00:17:15.179
You lost because you got greedy
trying to beat me.

00:17:16.514 --> 00:17:18.266
You were clueless, stupid

00:17:18.349 --> 00:17:20.893
and had no awareness
of your place or the situation.

00:17:22.145 --> 00:17:24.355
And you kept poking at me.

00:17:27.942 --> 00:17:31.779
You just got unlucky.

00:17:35.074 --> 00:17:36.075
Happy?

00:17:46.419 --> 00:17:47.545
Bitch.

00:18:13.779 --> 00:18:15.531
Why are you here this late?

00:18:15.865 --> 00:18:17.658
And where are you going this late?

00:18:17.742 --> 00:18:19.577
I heard about your grandfather.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.329
I was going to call later--

00:18:21.996 --> 00:18:24.457
You won't even take my calls now.
When exactly is later?

00:18:29.712 --> 00:18:32.131
Your mom got a kidney from you

00:18:32.215 --> 00:18:34.383
your grandfather died

00:18:34.467 --> 00:18:36.427
and now you come
to take it out on me?

00:18:37.178 --> 00:18:40.139
Do I have to pick up your calls
on command?

00:18:40.223 --> 00:18:41.807
Sorry

00:18:41.891 --> 00:18:44.435
but I don't have the luxury
of waiting by the phone for you.

00:18:44.518 --> 00:18:46.145
I told you to wait.

00:18:46.395 --> 00:18:49.523
If you waited, I would come to you.
That was the one thing I asked you.

00:18:49.607 --> 00:18:51.108
And you couldn't even do that?

00:18:54.237 --> 00:18:55.905
You knew I was an illegitimate child

00:18:58.783 --> 00:19:01.744
and that I had
a different biological father.

00:19:03.788 --> 00:19:04.789
Is that true?

00:19:07.875 --> 00:19:08.876
It's not, right?

00:19:10.294 --> 00:19:11.629
So, you finally found out.

00:19:13.923 --> 00:19:17.051
Now you know
why I went through all that.

00:19:19.262 --> 00:19:20.429
How does it feel now?

00:19:21.931 --> 00:19:22.932
Relieved?

00:19:31.983 --> 00:19:33.359
Why did you lie to me?

00:19:33.442 --> 00:19:34.443
Jun-seo.

00:19:36.529 --> 00:19:38.364
I never lied to you.

00:19:39.156 --> 00:19:41.158
I just didn't tell you.

00:19:42.159 --> 00:19:44.412
And shouldn't you be grateful to me?

00:19:45.663 --> 00:19:47.540
Because you were kept in the dark

00:19:47.873 --> 00:19:50.418
you got help from your grandfather

00:19:50.501 --> 00:19:52.753
lived in a nice home,
and wrote in peace.

00:19:54.171 --> 00:19:55.548
If I had told you then

00:19:57.008 --> 00:19:58.968
how different
would your life have been?

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:03.014
You would have run away,
hidden, or suffered

00:20:03.097 --> 00:20:04.181
like an idiot.

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.351
So...

00:20:10.646 --> 00:20:13.190
you're saying you did that for me?

00:20:13.524 --> 00:20:14.525
Yes.

00:20:15.526 --> 00:20:16.986
Can you say I'm wrong?

00:20:17.737 --> 00:20:21.240
Everything you enjoyed
because you were Yoon Jun-seo.

00:20:21.324 --> 00:20:22.950
Can you deny all of that?

00:20:25.828 --> 00:20:27.330
This is why I didn't tell you.

00:20:28.414 --> 00:20:30.666
Because you wouldn't be able
to handle it.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.084
I would have endured.

00:20:34.962 --> 00:20:37.548
If you hadn't lied
or hid it from me...

00:20:39.383 --> 00:20:43.262
If you had told me
that you suffered because of me...

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.018
I would have endured
anything for you.

00:20:52.188 --> 00:20:53.189
Somehow.

00:22:36.167 --> 00:22:37.460
- Hello, ma'am.
- Hello, ma'am.

00:24:08.551 --> 00:24:11.136
Actress Baek Ah-jin
and CEO Moon Do-hyuk

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:13.973
have officially tied the knot,
holding a wedding ceremony

00:24:14.056 --> 00:24:15.891
at a cathedral in Sicily.

00:24:15.975 --> 00:24:19.228
As the marriage between a top actress
and a chaebol businessman

00:24:19.311 --> 00:24:21.272
their union has been dubbed
the wedding of the century

00:24:21.355 --> 00:24:24.108
drawing widespread attention.

00:24:24.191 --> 00:24:26.652
Speculation continues about
where the newlyweds will establish...

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:29.655
She's out of the picture.

00:24:31.448 --> 00:24:32.616
- What?
- Kid.

00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:34.285
My instincts are razor sharp.

00:24:34.368 --> 00:24:36.704
Baek Ah-jin. She's the broom, right?

00:24:40.165 --> 00:24:41.166
Hey.

00:24:43.752 --> 00:24:45.796
- Do you know this man?
- Of course.

00:24:46.422 --> 00:24:48.632
Who in Korea doesn't know
Moon Do-hyuk?

00:24:48.716 --> 00:24:50.759
He's rich, handsome, and competent.

00:24:50.843 --> 00:24:51.844
He's perfect.

00:24:53.929 --> 00:24:56.432
Anyway, it's over now that
she married into a chaebol family.

00:24:57.975 --> 00:25:01.061
She achieved every woman's dream.
Just wish her well now.

00:25:01.562 --> 00:25:03.272
Once she's with a guy like that...

00:25:06.191 --> 00:25:07.693
even stalkers would give up.

00:25:09.486 --> 00:25:10.654
You should let her go, too.

00:25:13.324 --> 00:25:16.827
And the office fire turned out to be
a simple electrical short.

00:25:17.202 --> 00:25:20.039
Why spin stories
about warnings and threats?

00:25:33.636 --> 00:25:34.637
Sure.

00:25:35.971 --> 00:25:37.056
I guess that's all it was.

00:25:46.231 --> 00:25:47.733
Can you say I'm wrong?

00:25:49.568 --> 00:25:52.696
Everything you enjoyed
because you were Yoon Jun-seo.

00:25:53.656 --> 00:25:55.282
Can you deny all of that?

00:26:10.839 --> 00:26:12.508
LENA

00:26:20.182 --> 00:26:21.392
Will you be gone long?

00:26:22.726 --> 00:26:23.852
Yes.

00:26:24.436 --> 00:26:25.521
A very long time.

00:26:27.439 --> 00:26:28.774
I won't come back at all if I can.

00:26:29.566 --> 00:26:31.652
Text me if you get bored.

00:26:33.570 --> 00:26:34.571
I won't.

00:26:36.865 --> 00:26:38.951
I might want to come back home.

00:26:40.244 --> 00:26:41.704
Can I give you a piece of advice?

00:26:42.830 --> 00:26:45.249
Get away from Baek Ah-jin, too.

00:26:46.542 --> 00:26:48.252
I'm not telling you to come to me.

00:26:49.086 --> 00:26:52.965
But I hope that you will live
your own life now.

00:26:55.300 --> 00:26:56.427
As human Yoon Jun-seo.

00:26:59.930 --> 00:27:00.931
Yes.

00:27:01.724 --> 00:27:02.725
I will.

00:27:05.102 --> 00:27:07.896
And I'm not going to write anymore.

00:27:09.356 --> 00:27:11.608
- I doubt it.
- I mean it.

00:27:13.318 --> 00:27:16.029
I'm putting down writing,
and I'm letting go of Ah-jin.

00:27:16.405 --> 00:27:18.574
I want to give myself some time.

00:27:18.657 --> 00:27:19.950
Good choice.

00:27:20.033 --> 00:27:22.369
You might finally start acting
like a human being.

00:27:22.453 --> 00:27:24.246
Too bad I won't be around to see it.

00:27:26.665 --> 00:27:28.041
Take care.

00:27:41.972 --> 00:27:42.973
I'm leaving.

00:27:57.196 --> 00:27:59.907
AMEN TO NOTHING

00:28:54.503 --> 00:28:57.422
I want to look around a bit.
Can you open the door?

00:28:57.506 --> 00:29:00.968
I'm afraid only Mr. Moon is allowed
into the third-floor study, ma'am.

00:29:05.764 --> 00:29:06.765
Is that right?

00:29:09.726 --> 00:29:11.436
I just want to look.

00:29:12.229 --> 00:29:13.355
I can't even do that?

00:29:15.023 --> 00:29:16.942
Am I not also
the master of this house?

00:29:23.323 --> 00:29:27.452
Even the previous madam
wasn't allowed.

00:29:27.536 --> 00:29:29.454
It's entirely
Mr. Moon's private space.

00:29:30.163 --> 00:29:31.874
That makes me feel weird.

00:29:36.712 --> 00:29:40.424
If she wasn't allowed,
does that mean I'm also not allowed?

00:29:43.302 --> 00:29:45.012
I'm a little hurt, Ms. Gong.

00:29:45.929 --> 00:29:49.141
I'm not her, you know.

00:29:49.224 --> 00:29:50.350
If you insist

00:29:52.102 --> 00:29:54.396
- perhaps you could speak with--
- Forget it.

00:30:14.082 --> 00:30:16.126
The movie shoot starts
next week, right?

00:30:17.419 --> 00:30:18.545
How do you feel?

00:30:19.296 --> 00:30:21.715
It's the project you wanted so badly.

00:30:21.798 --> 00:30:22.799
Not bad.

00:30:23.967 --> 00:30:25.552
Thanks to my capable husband

00:30:25.636 --> 00:30:27.471
I met a skilled director.

00:30:27.554 --> 00:30:28.931
I guess I'm a little excited.

00:30:45.697 --> 00:30:48.617
What does it feel like
to get everything you want?

00:30:51.078 --> 00:30:52.287
Mostly boring.

00:30:53.080 --> 00:30:54.957
Especially when it's easy.

00:30:55.707 --> 00:30:57.084
Was I easy to get?

00:30:59.836 --> 00:31:01.296
You know the answer.

00:31:02.464 --> 00:31:06.259
You were someone
I invested a lot of effort into.

00:31:06.343 --> 00:31:08.303
So, it felt the best
when I finally had you.

00:31:08.387 --> 00:31:12.474
That's why I brought you
a major film so quickly.

00:31:16.019 --> 00:31:17.396
Do you have any other questions?

00:31:22.776 --> 00:31:24.820
Can I use your study

00:31:25.070 --> 00:31:26.279
on the third floor?

00:31:30.117 --> 00:31:31.535
The study?

00:31:33.161 --> 00:31:34.329
Why?

00:31:35.956 --> 00:31:39.418
It's hard to concentrate
on my script.

00:31:40.252 --> 00:31:42.337
I want a quiet space to practice

00:31:42.421 --> 00:31:44.047
but the house is always crowded.

00:31:49.094 --> 00:31:54.433
The study won't magically make you
practice better, though.

00:31:55.100 --> 00:31:57.602
I'll practice with you instead.

00:31:58.103 --> 00:31:59.104
You will?

00:31:59.646 --> 00:32:00.647
Yes.

00:32:08.655 --> 00:32:10.741
Just read this section.

00:32:12.617 --> 00:32:14.661
- Let's see.
- But

00:32:14.745 --> 00:32:16.329
are you sure you can handle it?

00:32:17.706 --> 00:32:19.958
What kind of character
am I supposed to play?

00:32:20.375 --> 00:32:22.294
It would help to know
so I can match the tone.

00:32:24.296 --> 00:32:26.923
He's the real culprit
behind the murder

00:32:27.007 --> 00:32:28.800
of the protagonist's family.

00:32:30.510 --> 00:32:32.137
I take revenge on him later.

00:32:33.764 --> 00:32:35.182
A murderer, then.

00:32:36.683 --> 00:32:38.769
Have you ever killed anyone?

00:32:40.687 --> 00:32:42.689
- Pardon?
- Or did you have

00:32:42.773 --> 00:32:44.357
anyone you wanted to kill?

00:32:49.196 --> 00:32:50.238
Do-hyuk?

00:32:51.865 --> 00:32:52.949
Did I ever tell you

00:32:54.159 --> 00:32:55.702
why I divorced my ex-wife?

00:32:57.162 --> 00:33:00.832
She kept saying she wanted to kill me

00:33:01.875 --> 00:33:02.959
so I divorced her.

00:33:06.254 --> 00:33:09.925
I gave her everything she wanted
and treated her like royalty.

00:33:10.008 --> 00:33:11.510
Maybe that's why.

00:33:11.593 --> 00:33:14.513
Whenever something went
slightly wrong or didn't satisfy her

00:33:14.596 --> 00:33:16.139
she couldn't handle it.

00:33:16.431 --> 00:33:17.641
She blamed everything on me

00:33:18.475 --> 00:33:20.018
saying that I made her that way.

00:33:22.354 --> 00:33:26.149
Eventually,
she had a complete breakdown.

00:33:26.233 --> 00:33:28.276
Now she's being treated
in a psychiatric hospital.

00:33:30.403 --> 00:33:34.241
Maybe I treated her too well,
above her place.

00:33:35.575 --> 00:33:37.202
It broke my heart.

00:33:42.415 --> 00:33:43.416
Did I shock you?

00:33:45.210 --> 00:33:47.879
I went off track, didn't I?

00:33:48.213 --> 00:33:49.214
Not really.

00:34:02.519 --> 00:34:04.396
Ready, action!

00:34:15.740 --> 00:34:17.742
Sister, I know
who killed your family.

00:34:20.579 --> 00:34:21.955
It's someone you know.

00:34:40.390 --> 00:34:42.392
- I'll go ahead and order first.
- Sure.

00:34:54.988 --> 00:34:56.948
Have you ever killed anyone?

00:34:57.324 --> 00:34:59.326
- Pardon?
- Or did you have

00:34:59.409 --> 00:35:01.036
anyone you wanted to kill?

00:35:04.748 --> 00:35:06.208
What a psycho.

00:35:09.419 --> 00:35:13.256
They say Baek Ah-jin's husband
got her this role.

00:35:13.340 --> 00:35:15.967
Figures. I thought it was weird
how public opinion flipped overnight

00:35:16.051 --> 00:35:18.136
after her image collapsed like that.

00:35:18.220 --> 00:35:19.638
Someone must have pulled strings.

00:35:20.805 --> 00:35:23.225
Man, I wish I had
a rich husband, too.

00:35:23.308 --> 00:35:24.976
I'd live however I want.

00:35:25.060 --> 00:35:26.061
Seriously.

00:35:26.144 --> 00:35:28.355
Life is so unpredictable.

00:35:29.064 --> 00:35:31.691
Who knew she'd break up
with Heo In-gang like that

00:35:32.067 --> 00:35:35.153
and immediately marry
into a chaebol family?

00:35:35.237 --> 00:35:38.323
She obviously married him for money.

00:35:38.406 --> 00:35:40.325
It won't last.

00:35:40.408 --> 00:35:42.494
Bet they'll have
divorce rumors next year.

00:35:43.787 --> 00:35:45.247
Hey, that was a little harsh.

00:35:48.500 --> 00:35:49.584
Enjoy your coffee.

00:36:01.179 --> 00:36:05.600
RIP
THE LATE YOON SEUNG-MO

00:36:23.994 --> 00:36:25.078
Thank you.

00:36:27.706 --> 00:36:29.165
Thank you for taking me in...

00:36:31.293 --> 00:36:32.502
and raising me.

00:36:36.965 --> 00:36:38.258
And I'm sorry.

00:36:41.303 --> 00:36:43.305
I don't think I can come back.

00:37:24.137 --> 00:37:25.555
FOR MENSTRUAL CRAMPS

00:38:33.540 --> 00:38:34.707
Who brought this here?

00:38:55.937 --> 00:38:56.938
You're home.

00:38:58.440 --> 00:38:59.899
You're early today.

00:39:01.109 --> 00:39:02.110
Yes.

00:39:04.070 --> 00:39:05.613
How was today's shoot?

00:39:05.697 --> 00:39:06.781
Did you do well?

00:39:07.991 --> 00:39:09.117
Of course.

00:39:11.828 --> 00:39:13.538
You look a bit tired.

00:39:13.621 --> 00:39:15.290
Are you feeling unwell?

00:39:17.542 --> 00:39:18.543
Do-hyuk.

00:39:19.752 --> 00:39:21.421
There's something I want to ask.

00:39:26.384 --> 00:39:28.803
Never mind. Maybe I'm just tired.

00:39:32.724 --> 00:39:34.309
You don't seem to have a fever.

00:39:35.143 --> 00:39:36.644
Are you sure you're okay?

00:39:38.146 --> 00:39:39.481
It's just fatigue.

00:39:40.190 --> 00:39:41.441
I'm fine.

00:39:41.524 --> 00:39:42.525
All right.

00:39:43.401 --> 00:39:45.069
Then I'll go shower.

00:39:45.153 --> 00:39:46.321
Get some rest in the meantime.

00:40:08.426 --> 00:40:10.094
Since when was it like this?

00:40:10.470 --> 00:40:11.554
I apologize, ma'am.

00:40:11.638 --> 00:40:13.765
I noticed it was broken this morning

00:40:13.848 --> 00:40:16.100
but I forgot
because things got hectic.

00:40:16.184 --> 00:40:17.602
I'll fix it right away.

00:40:43.878 --> 00:40:45.838
You're just waiting
for time to pass, aren't you?

00:40:45.922 --> 00:40:46.923
But too bad for you.

00:40:48.550 --> 00:40:52.303
The moment you want so badly
will never come.

00:42:08.588 --> 00:42:10.006
What happened to you?

00:42:10.089 --> 00:42:11.799
You never call me out first.

00:42:20.099 --> 00:42:21.225
You okay?

00:42:24.103 --> 00:42:26.022
You look better than I expected.

00:42:31.694 --> 00:42:35.657
I thought you'd be moping around
like some lost puppy.

00:42:35.740 --> 00:42:36.741
This guy.

00:42:39.202 --> 00:42:40.203
What is it?

00:42:41.079 --> 00:42:42.330
Why did you call me?

00:42:43.081 --> 00:42:44.248
Something's going on, right?

00:42:44.499 --> 00:42:47.669
I called you to drink.
We're at a bar. Why else?

00:42:50.088 --> 00:42:51.422
You're too old
for teenage turmoil now.

00:42:55.218 --> 00:42:56.302
What about you?

00:42:56.719 --> 00:42:58.680
I've always wondered.

00:42:58.763 --> 00:43:00.682
How do you sacrifice your whole life

00:43:00.765 --> 00:43:03.559
just for the sake of another person?

00:43:09.399 --> 00:43:11.609
My life isn't worth

00:43:12.860 --> 00:43:14.153
betting on.

00:43:15.655 --> 00:43:17.448
I'm the delinquent son
who killed his own dad.

00:43:18.282 --> 00:43:19.867
No family wants me

00:43:21.160 --> 00:43:22.912
nor do I have a clue what I live for.

00:43:23.871 --> 00:43:25.039
Who's going to complain

00:43:26.124 --> 00:43:29.001
if I bet a life like that
on someone else?

00:43:42.974 --> 00:43:44.142
You should start

00:43:45.226 --> 00:43:46.561
living your own life.

00:43:49.021 --> 00:43:52.150
So you don't end up like me,
not knowing where to go.

00:43:52.817 --> 00:43:53.818
Idiot.

00:43:55.236 --> 00:43:57.238
You're so fucking drunk right now.

00:44:00.241 --> 00:44:01.409
Excuse me.

00:44:01.701 --> 00:44:03.578
I'll handle my life.

00:44:03.661 --> 00:44:06.122
You deal with yours.

00:44:06.205 --> 00:44:08.124
You're the one acting pitiful.

00:44:08.207 --> 00:44:09.459
Who's the lost puppy here?

00:44:09.876 --> 00:44:10.877
Unbelievable.

00:44:12.670 --> 00:44:13.671
Jun-seo.

00:44:14.672 --> 00:44:16.132
If you don't know where to go

00:44:17.216 --> 00:44:18.384
do you want me to show you?

00:44:26.517 --> 00:44:28.978
Let's go for Round Two.
You're paying.

00:44:29.645 --> 00:44:30.646
Deal?

00:44:43.493 --> 00:44:45.036
Lady!

00:44:45.119 --> 00:44:47.663
Lady, are you done yet?

00:44:47.747 --> 00:44:49.874
Gosh, you're so slow.
Hurry up already.

00:44:49.957 --> 00:44:50.958
Yes, ma'am.

00:45:02.887 --> 00:45:03.888
I'm here.

00:45:04.972 --> 00:45:05.973
You came.

00:45:07.308 --> 00:45:08.309
Good.

00:45:20.154 --> 00:45:22.448
- Ms. Baek, please say a word!
- A comment, please!

00:45:22.532 --> 00:45:24.367
- Will there be another movie?
- About your return!

00:45:24.450 --> 00:45:25.451
Ms. Baek Ah-jin!

00:45:28.329 --> 00:45:30.623
- Just one comment!
- Ms. Baek Ah-jin!

00:45:44.387 --> 00:45:45.388
Excuse me.

00:45:59.235 --> 00:46:00.236
Long time no see.

00:46:05.741 --> 00:46:08.244
How did you recognize me?

00:46:08.619 --> 00:46:11.581
How could I not?
You were staring at me from there.

00:46:15.418 --> 00:46:17.253
But what brings you here?

00:46:17.837 --> 00:46:19.380
Nothing, well...

00:46:19.463 --> 00:46:21.924
You just stopped contacting me

00:46:22.008 --> 00:46:24.510
and I haven't seen you in a while.

00:46:24.927 --> 00:46:28.014
So, I just wanted to check
if you were doing okay.

00:46:33.811 --> 00:46:35.104
You are okay, right?

00:46:36.397 --> 00:46:38.024
You look pale.

00:46:38.107 --> 00:46:39.817
There's no life in your face
as if you're sick.

00:46:40.943 --> 00:46:41.944
I'm not sure

00:46:42.945 --> 00:46:44.739
if I'm doing okay.

00:46:47.658 --> 00:46:49.785
It's just that I've been having
nightmares every night.

00:46:50.453 --> 00:46:51.454
I'm just tired.

00:46:59.503 --> 00:47:01.380
What?

00:47:01.464 --> 00:47:03.049
Did you fall for me or something?

00:47:03.132 --> 00:47:05.009
Stop staring.

00:47:07.261 --> 00:47:08.262
Hey, Jae-oh.

00:47:09.305 --> 00:47:11.349
Can you look
into Moon Do-hyuk for me?

00:47:12.266 --> 00:47:13.267
Moon Do-hyuk?

00:47:14.226 --> 00:47:15.436
Your husband?

00:47:20.066 --> 00:47:21.067
I knew it.

00:47:21.317 --> 00:47:23.319
That bastard was up to something,
wasn't he?

00:47:23.402 --> 00:47:24.695
It's not that.

00:47:24.779 --> 00:47:26.447
I just have a weird feeling.

00:47:26.781 --> 00:47:29.283
Find out about his ex-wife in detail.

00:47:30.076 --> 00:47:31.369
And where she is now.

00:47:31.702 --> 00:47:33.287
Even better
if I can talk to her in person.

00:47:33.371 --> 00:47:34.413
Hold on.

00:47:34.497 --> 00:47:36.332
He had an ex-wife?

00:47:36.415 --> 00:47:38.042
So, he's been married before?

00:47:40.336 --> 00:47:41.337
Jeez.

00:47:42.129 --> 00:47:44.298
I knew I hated that guy from day one.

00:47:44.924 --> 00:47:46.676
Why are you getting mad?

00:47:47.885 --> 00:47:49.303
Why did you marry

00:47:49.553 --> 00:47:52.181
someone like him?
You're way out of his league.

00:47:52.682 --> 00:47:54.475
Cut the nonsense.

00:47:54.558 --> 00:47:56.811
- Can you do it or not?
- Don't even bother asking.

00:47:56.894 --> 00:48:00.606
Just wait. I'll dig up everything
and won't leave a single detail out.

00:48:17.581 --> 00:48:21.585
Ma'am, have some warm tea before bed.

00:48:22.628 --> 00:48:24.797
I don't want any.

00:48:28.676 --> 00:48:31.846
After that day,
Mr. Moon insisted that you drink it.

00:48:37.101 --> 00:48:40.896
If you refuse, he'll get on my case.

00:49:34.575 --> 00:49:35.618
Where's Ah-jin?

00:51:10.754 --> 00:51:13.632
Such lovely weather, ma'am.

00:51:14.341 --> 00:51:16.635
I wish every day were like this.

00:51:17.928 --> 00:51:18.929
Right?

00:51:28.689 --> 00:51:33.402
"I pray that every path I take
be cursed with blood."

00:52:08.187 --> 00:52:09.813
AMEN TO NOTHING

00:53:49.788 --> 00:53:52.791
It fucking pissed me off even more
when I thought about it.

00:53:53.375 --> 00:53:56.754
I crawled into your house
just to watch you fall

00:53:57.504 --> 00:53:58.964
and this is how you treat me?

00:54:01.050 --> 00:54:03.594
My whole life is ruined
because of you.

00:54:04.303 --> 00:54:05.471
And you...

00:54:05.846 --> 00:54:06.847
It's not fair

00:54:08.057 --> 00:54:12.144
you get to rise even higher
and live in this mansion.

00:54:14.855 --> 00:54:16.065
Who said you could?

00:54:17.441 --> 00:54:19.401
You will never get away from me!

00:54:28.118 --> 00:54:30.412
Why you?

00:54:31.038 --> 00:54:33.582
Why does a devil like you
get to do well?

00:54:36.418 --> 00:54:37.419
Sung-hee.

00:54:38.003 --> 00:54:41.632
You failed because you were stupid.
Don't blame other people.

00:54:42.466 --> 00:54:45.135
Fine. If I can't be like you
because I'm stupid

00:54:45.219 --> 00:54:47.179
you can become like me.

00:54:47.262 --> 00:54:49.723
Right? That's easier, isn't it?

00:54:49.807 --> 00:54:51.433
Dragging you down to the bottom.

00:54:54.728 --> 00:54:57.856
You're also finished
if that pretty face gets ruined.

00:55:01.443 --> 00:55:02.444
But Ah-jin

00:55:03.112 --> 00:55:04.196
you know what?

00:55:05.989 --> 00:55:09.201
Do you think your marriage is

00:55:09.284 --> 00:55:10.411
a blessing or a curse?

00:55:12.955 --> 00:55:14.748
Your husband...

00:55:46.488 --> 00:55:47.614
Sung-hee.

00:56:33.619 --> 00:56:37.706
DEAR X

00:58:58.180 --> 00:59:00.182
Subtitles by Ho-young Yun